00:32:01.042 --> 00:32:03.875
Otherwise they're gonna find a boy's body
floating in the Buriganga.

268
00:32:14.375 --> 00:32:15.750
We're getting played.

269
00:32:18.750 --> 00:32:20.625
- Give me verbal.
<i>- G here.</i>

270
00:32:21.292 --> 00:32:22.292
Thiago?

271
00:32:23.708 --> 00:32:25.375
<i>- Thiago?</i>
- Shit.

272
00:32:28.167 --> 00:32:29.458
<i>Thiago?</i>

273
00:32:30.667 --> 00:32:33.625
<i>Tyler. something's wrong.
Hold your position.</i>

274
00:32:33.708 --> 00:32:34.708
Holding.

275
00:32:35.458 --> 00:32:37.875
G. you got the eyes on the boat?

276
00:32:37.958 --> 00:32:40.833
I'm looking at it right now.
Our boys haven't come up yet.

277
00:32:40.917 --> 00:32:42.542
I'm moving in for a closer look.

278
00:32:44.750 --> 00:32:48.625
Colonel. stand by.
We think we found something.

279
00:32:49.208 --> 00:32:51.417
- Nik. you're gonna wanna see this.
- What is it?

280
00:32:52.708 --> 00:32:53.708
Shit!

281
00:32:53.792 --> 00:32:55.667
Tyler. two inbound police boats.

282
00:32:55.750 --> 00:32:58.375
<i>- Two hundred meters and closing in fast.</i>
- G?

283
00:33:06.542 --> 00:33:07.982
There's someone else in those woods.

284
00:33:08.333 --> 00:33:11.000
About a hundred meters out
and closing in on your position.

285
00:33:37.708 --> 00:33:42.458
Kid... Move fast. Stay low. Go!

286
00:33:55.292 --> 00:33:56.292
They found the boat.

287
00:33:58.417 --> 00:34:00.458
<i>We need air support
by the river.</i>

288
00:34:00.542 --> 00:34:02.000
<i>They're in the forest.</i>

289
00:34:02.083 --> 00:34:03.917
Tyler. chopper's inbound.

290
00:34:07.500 --> 00:34:08.500
Go. go!

291
00:34:19.125 --> 00:34:20.417
Down.

292
00:34:20.500 --> 00:34:21.792
Ovi. it's Saju!

293
00:34:22.417 --> 00:34:23.667
I'm here to take you home!

294
00:34:23.750 --> 00:34:25.917
- Saju. I'm here!
- Sit down and shut up!

295
00:34:32.167 --> 00:34:35.750
I need the boy! I won't hurt him!

296
00:34:35.833 --> 00:34:39.708
Okay. when I tell you to. run like hell
or I'm gonna kill you both. Understand?

297
00:34:42.750 --> 00:34:43.750
Go!

298
00:34:48.208 --> 00:34:49.208
Okay kid. go!

299
00:34:51.625 --> 00:34:54.000
Go on. kid. Go. go! Go! Come on.

300
00:34:54.083 --> 00:34:55.958
- Ovi!
- Move. boy!

301
00:34:56.042 --> 00:34:58.500
- Here. get in the car. Get in the car.
- Stop running!

302
00:35:21.292 --> 00:35:22.434
Shit!

303
00:35:25.708 --> 00:35:27.083
Come on! Go!

304
00:35:34.542 --> 00:35:36.458
Get down!

305
00:35:36.542 --> 00:35:37.958
Saju! Help!

306
00:35:41.125 --> 00:35:42.125
Hey! Hey!

307
00:35:42.625 --> 00:35:44.583
Please let me go!
Saju works for my father.

308
00:35:44.667 --> 00:35:47.458
I work for your father.
But something is fucked here.

309
00:35:47.542 --> 00:35:50.393
Saju could have a deal with the men
who grabbed you and send you back to them.

310
00:35:50.417 --> 00:35:52.625
- Then take me to the police.
- The cops are in on it.

311
00:35:52.708 --> 00:35:54.708
Look. if you wanna live.
you have to trust me.

312
00:35:56.542 --> 00:35:58.875
I need eyes. Radio's compromised.
Call my sat.

313
00:36:01.333 --> 00:36:02.643
<i>Turn right.
after the bridge.</i>

314
00:36:02.667 --> 00:36:04.427
- How far past the gate?
<i>- What gate?</i>

315
00:36:05.667 --> 00:36:08.292
<i>- Turn right.</i>
- Can't. Bloody truck is in the way.

316
00:36:14.500 --> 00:36:15.958
<i>Tyler. on your right.</i>

317
00:36:21.917 --> 00:36:23.167
Fuck off!

318
00:37:02.500 --> 00:37:03.980
<i>Up ahead. make a left.</i>

319
00:37:05.458 --> 00:37:09.000
<i>No. no. no! Left! You just passed it.</i>

320
00:37:09.083 --> 00:37:10.167
For fuck's sake!

321
00:37:14.917 --> 00:37:15.917
Get down!

322
00:37:29.292 --> 00:37:30.708
I'm in survival mode.

323
00:37:31.875 --> 00:37:34.083
- Put your belt on.
- What belt?

324
00:37:34.167 --> 00:37:35.333
Your fucking seat belt.

325
00:37:35.417 --> 00:37:37.542
It's been on.
You drive like you're insane!

326
00:37:38.958 --> 00:37:39.958
Hold tight.

327
00:37:43.167 --> 00:37:45.333
- You okay. kid?
- I'm fine.

328
00:37:45.417 --> 00:37:47.750
We gotta move. Go. Up the stairs.

329
00:38:04.417 --> 00:38:05.777
Go. go. go!

330
00:38:29.542 --> 00:38:30.625
This way.

331
00:39:35.208 --> 00:39:36.083
Shh.

332
00:39:36.167 --> 00:39:39.542
Come on. Come on.

333
00:39:46.833 --> 00:39:47.833
Move!

334
00:40:11.250 --> 00:40:13.875
Help! Help! Help!

335
00:40:20.417 --> 00:40:22.377
Come here.

336
00:40:32.458 --> 00:40:33.792
Come here. you little shit...

337
00:41:03.375 --> 00:41:04.417
Run. go.

338
00:41:11.250 --> 00:41:13.542
Get up the stairs. Go. Come on. Move!

339
00:41:24.458 --> 00:41:25.458
Get down.

340
00:41:28.042 --> 00:41:29.322
All right. kid. Do you trust me?

341
00:41:29.375 --> 00:41:30.500
- No.
- Good.

342
00:41:31.583 --> 00:41:32.583
No!

343
00:41:38.625 --> 00:41:39.667
Get up. kid.

344
00:41:54.792 --> 00:41:56.000
Okay!

345
00:42:08.625 --> 00:42:09.958
Stay on my shoulder. all right?

346
00:43:59.125 --> 00:44:00.167
Fuck.

347
00:44:14.458 --> 00:44:16.792
Help me! Let me go!

348
00:44:23.375 --> 00:44:24.917
Let me go!

349
00:44:28.125 --> 00:44:29.208
Help!

350
00:44:30.042 --> 00:44:31.434
Hey.
I am telling you to stop.

351
00:44:31.458 --> 00:44:32.792
Stop there or I will kill you.

352
00:44:41.125 --> 00:44:42.625
Are you hurt?

353
00:45:06.083 --> 00:45:08.375
Get in. kid. Come on. Come on!

354
00:45:13.917 --> 00:45:15.750
- You hit him with the truck.
- Yeah.

355
00:45:24.875 --> 00:45:26.250
They're still following us.

356
00:45:29.833 --> 00:45:30.833
Hold on.

357
00:46:07.667 --> 00:46:10.083
All right. kid.
I need you to slide on over here.

358
00:46:11.917 --> 00:46:13.597
Okay. we're gonna jump on three.
All right?

359
00:46:13.667 --> 00:46:14.917
- What?
- One...

360
00:46:31.958 --> 00:46:35.198
<i>The vehicle
crashed. It flipped over and is in flames.</i>

361
00:46:37.292 --> 00:46:38.750
I want to see the bodies.

362
00:46:41.583 --> 00:46:42.875
We're coming.

363
00:47:37.167 --> 00:47:38.487
They're still alive.

364
00:47:38.750 --> 00:47:41.542
One is seriously injured.

365
00:47:44.792 --> 00:47:49.417
I want every gun in Dhaka
pointed at this guy.

366
00:48:06.208 --> 00:48:07.848
All right. Close the door.
Close the door.

367
00:48:45.833 --> 00:48:46.833
Can you give me a hand?

368
00:48:49.000 --> 00:48:50.958
I need eyes. Hold that on there.

369
00:48:52.583 --> 00:48:55.042
Just hook it through there
and then pull it back this way.

370
00:48:55.125 --> 00:48:56.125
Yeah.

371
00:49:01.083 --> 00:49:02.083
Yep.

372
00:49:02.208 --> 00:49:03.458
- Yeah?
- Yeah. I got it.

373
00:49:19.000 --> 00:49:19.833
Yeah?

374
00:49:19.917 --> 00:49:22.875
<i>Our new friend is Saju Rav.
Ex-Special Forces.</i>

375
00:49:22.958 --> 00:49:24.667
<i>He works for the kid's father.</i>

376
00:49:27.500 --> 00:49:28.500
We were played.

377
00:49:29.583 --> 00:49:31.208
Second transfer never came through.

378
00:49:31.750 --> 00:49:34.958
<i>Mahajan got us to do the heavy lifting.
and he doesn't wanna pay.</i>

379
00:49:35.583 --> 00:49:36.583
What about G?

380
00:49:37.583 --> 00:49:39.042
<i>The whole team is dead.</i>

381
00:49:39.708 --> 00:49:40.708
Shit.

382
00:49:42.375 --> 00:49:45.667
- City's on lockdown. You got cover?
<i>- Yeah.</i>

383
00:49:46.083 --> 00:49:47.083
<i>And the kid?</i>

384
00:49:49.583 --> 00:49:50.583
He's with me.

385
00:49:52.125 --> 00:49:54.792
There's a clearing on east side
of Sultana Kamal Bridge.

386
00:49:54.875 --> 00:49:58.625
<i>just outside the city.
We can send a chopper and get you out.</i>

387
00:49:59.667 --> 00:50:02.417
- How far?
<i>- Four kilometers.</i>

388
00:50:06.417 --> 00:50:08.333
You gotta leave the kid behind. Tyler.

389
00:50:16.667 --> 00:50:17.667
<i>Tyler?</i>

390
00:50:24.250 --> 00:50:25.250
Tyler?

391
00:50:28.958 --> 00:50:29.958
That's not the job.

392
00:50:30.042 --> 00:50:31.500
The job is fucked.

393
00:50:36.792 --> 00:50:38.375
Just find my money. Nik.

394
00:50:50.375 --> 00:50:52.542
Are you gonna
leave me in the street?

395
00:50:55.167 --> 00:50:57.167
Your phone... It's loud.

396
00:50:59.917 --> 00:51:02.667
The only chance
of getting my money is you. mate. So...

397
00:51:03.917 --> 00:51:04.917
no.

398
00:51:08.750 --> 00:51:10.125
I'm like a package then.

399
00:51:12.250 --> 00:51:13.333
Yeah. pretty much.

400
00:51:14.792 --> 00:51:16.292
In brown paper.

401
00:51:25.625 --> 00:51:26.708
What are you doing?

402
00:51:27.333 --> 00:51:28.333
This?

403
00:51:29.083 --> 00:51:32.958
Piano. I play the piano when I'm nervous.

404
00:51:34.375 --> 00:51:35.375
It helps.

405
00:51:36.958 --> 00:51:38.667
My father hates it when I do it.

406
00:51:44.125 --> 00:51:46.083
He thinks of me the same way you do.

407
00:51:48.417 --> 00:51:50.042
More like a thing than a person.

408
00:51:55.500 --> 00:51:57.625
I didn't... I didn't mean it like that.

409
00:52:03.000 --> 00:52:04.000
It's okay.

410
00:52:42.958 --> 00:52:43.958
Sir.

411
00:52:44.708 --> 00:52:46.083
How many beds?

412
00:53:34.292 --> 00:53:35.292
Saju?

413
00:53:35.917 --> 00:53:37.583
<i>Hey. beautiful.</i>

414
00:53:39.542 --> 00:53:40.750
Are you okay?

415
00:53:41.417 --> 00:53:43.000
<i>Listen to me carefully.</i>

416
00:53:43.833 --> 00:53:46.417
If you don't hear from me
in the next 12 hours...

417
00:53:47.792 --> 00:53:49.875
take the cash and go.

418
00:53:51.750 --> 00:53:52.917
Disappear.

419
00:53:55.250 --> 00:53:56.667
You understand me. right?

420
00:53:57.667 --> 00:53:58.833
<i>I understand.</i>

421
00:54:00.208 --> 00:54:01.292
<i>Are you okay?</i>

422
00:54:02.625 --> 00:54:03.625
I'm fine.

423
00:54:05.333 --> 00:54:06.958
Just tired.

424
00:54:12.167 --> 00:54:13.208
I love you.

425
00:54:14.167 --> 00:54:15.250
<i>I love you. too.</i>

426
00:54:17.583 --> 00:54:19.000
<i>Put Aarav on the phone.</i>

427
00:54:22.708 --> 00:54:25.042
Aarav.
Papa's on the phone.

428
00:54:27.708 --> 00:54:28.708
Sadia.

429
00:54:30.625 --> 00:54:31.875
Hello. Papa.

430
00:54:32.458 --> 00:54:33.792
Hey. champ.

431
00:54:35.000 --> 00:54:37.083
Are you coming home soon?

432
00:54:37.792 --> 00:54:40.750
Yes. it'll be very soon.

433
00:54:40.833 --> 00:54:41.750
<i>When?</i>

434
00:54:41.833 --> 00:54:42.833
When?

435
00:54:46.167 --> 00:54:48.125
When you wake up in the morning.

436
00:54:51.667 --> 00:54:53.833
You help your mother. okay?

437
00:54:54.833 --> 00:54:57.792
<i>Yes. Papa. I will.</i>

438
00:54:59.667 --> 00:55:01.083
I love you.

439
00:55:04.417 --> 00:55:05.417
Always.

440
00:55:08.083 --> 00:55:09.750
I love you too. Papa.

441
00:55:11.625 --> 00:55:12.625
Bye.

442
00:55:29.750 --> 00:55:30.583
Yeah.

443
00:55:30.667 --> 00:55:33.417
<i>You got a chopper.
Meet you at the east side of the bridge.</i>

444
00:55:33.500 --> 00:55:34.750
Copy. I'm on the move.

445
00:55:37.000 --> 00:55:39.917
Kid. Kid. Hey. come on.

446
00:55:51.875 --> 00:55:52.875
Hey.

447
00:55:55.875 --> 00:55:56.875
Get in. go.

448
00:56:14.125 --> 00:56:15.208
Come on. you bastard.

449
00:56:22.542 --> 00:56:23.542
Get out of the car.

450
00:56:26.292 --> 00:56:27.583
Go. go. go. go. go!

451
00:56:35.083 --> 00:56:36.917
- Stay there!
- Yeah.

452
00:56:54.083 --> 00:56:57.792
- Hey. this guy wants my gun!
- My ankle is broken!

453
00:57:00.167 --> 00:57:01.333
Leave my gun.

454
00:57:01.417 --> 00:57:02.667
Leave it!

455
00:57:02.750 --> 00:57:04.708
My friend is gonna shoot you!

456
00:57:04.792 --> 00:57:07.250
Hey! Give me my gun... Give it back!

457
00:57:07.333 --> 00:57:09.333
That's my gun. Give it back to me!

458
00:57:10.667 --> 00:57:13.467
- Give it back or I'll blow you away!
- I will finish you off.

459
00:57:13.750 --> 00:57:15.167
The fuck?

460
00:58:00.458 --> 00:58:01.583
Son of a bitch!

461
00:58:01.667 --> 00:58:03.792
I will finish you off!

462
00:58:20.583 --> 00:58:21.958
I'll kill you!

463
00:58:23.000 --> 00:58:24.542
I'll murder you.

464
00:58:26.583 --> 00:58:28.208
Piss off!

465
00:58:29.917 --> 00:58:31.542
Fucking shits.

466
00:58:31.625 --> 00:58:33.750
You are surrounded.

467
00:58:33.833 --> 00:58:35.583
Please surrender to DMP

468
00:58:35.667 --> 00:58:38.125
- or else you will be shot.
- Fuck! Come on. We gotta move.

469
00:58:38.208 --> 00:58:43.208
Shit! Go. go. go. go. go!

470
00:58:48.500 --> 00:58:50.042
All right. Get in.

471
00:59:21.208 --> 00:59:22.292
<i>Talk to me.</i>

472
00:59:22.375 --> 00:59:24.125
- Call Gaspar.
<i>- What's going on?</i>

473
00:59:24.208 --> 00:59:27.875
We just got attacked by the Goonies
from hell. We made it about four blocks.

474
00:59:27.958 --> 00:59:29.458
I said get rid of the kid.

475
00:59:29.542 --> 00:59:31.250
I don't give a shit what you said.

476
00:59:31.333 --> 00:59:33.333
We're in the worst smelling sewer
on the planet.

477
00:59:33.417 --> 00:59:36.458
There's about 200 cops over our heads.
Just call Gaspar.

478
00:59:36.542 --> 00:59:40.167
<i>- Tyler. I don't think that's a good idea.</i>
- The guy owes me his life. Nik.

479
00:59:40.250 --> 00:59:42.000
<i>- Tyler. I...</i>
- Call him.

480
00:59:54.000 --> 00:59:55.500
Your name's Tyler?

481
00:59:56.667 --> 00:59:57.667
Mmm-hmm.

482
01:00:03.292 --> 01:00:04.417
I'm Ovi.

483
01:00:07.083 --> 01:00:08.167
Nice to meet ya.

484
01:00:46.625 --> 01:00:48.542
Ugh. Jesus Christ!

485
01:01:17.208 --> 01:01:18.667
Hey. how's it going?

486
01:01:19.417 --> 01:01:20.917
Yeah. better after the shower.

487
01:01:34.083 --> 01:01:35.083
Cheers.

488
01:01:41.875 --> 01:01:43.125
Good to see you. man.

489
01:01:44.917 --> 01:01:46.333
I appreciate you coming for us.

490
01:01:46.875 --> 01:01:48.875
The hell is wrong with you?
Don't insult me.

491
01:01:51.333 --> 01:01:53.375
- You hungry?
- Yeah.

492
01:01:53.458 --> 01:01:54.542
Hey. how's that kid?

493
01:01:55.167 --> 01:01:56.417
Uh. he's resting.

494
01:01:58.667 --> 01:01:59.833
So. where are we?

495
01:02:00.500 --> 01:02:03.917
We are south of the city center.

496
01:02:04.417 --> 01:02:08.875
I told Nik that an extraction is...
It's not feasible.

497
01:02:08.958 --> 01:02:11.417
Well. you know. the city
is surrounded by rivers.

498
01:02:11.500 --> 01:02:13.083
There are bridges going in and out.

499
01:02:13.167 --> 01:02:18.417
But every one of those bridges currently
is blocked by a roadblock

500
01:02:18.500 --> 01:02:21.833
because you are a very popular individual.

501
01:02:24.667 --> 01:02:28.250
I figure we lie low a couple days.
we let the panic dissipate.

502
01:02:28.333 --> 01:02:33.500
And we'll get you going.
Now. my wife made that.

503
01:02:33.583 --> 01:02:35.583
So. I want you to be very careful
what you say.

504
01:02:36.417 --> 01:02:37.417
Your wife?

505
01:02:40.125 --> 01:02:41.458
And what's that for. the knee?

506
01:02:42.083 --> 01:02:44.333
Yeah. knee. back. shoulder...

507
01:02:44.875 --> 01:02:49.208
Hang on one sec... my knee.
Ow! Oh. God. Oh. it hurts.

508
01:02:50.167 --> 01:02:51.458
Two oughta do it.

509
01:02:56.958 --> 01:02:59.625
Okay. I gotta go. I gotta go.

510
01:03:00.125 --> 01:03:01.583
I gotta kiss my wife.

511
01:03:02.583 --> 01:03:06.667
But you stay here and rest up.
And I will be back.

512
01:03:09.333 --> 01:03:11.792
It's good to see you. man. I missed you.

513
01:04:16.125 --> 01:04:17.645
Don't you see I'm eating?

514
01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:20.083
- I had him...
- Had who?

515
01:04:20.167 --> 01:04:21.833
The man you want.

516
01:04:22.417 --> 01:04:24.417
I lost him...

517
01:04:24.500 --> 01:04:25.625
near the market.

518
01:04:26.625 --> 01:04:28.625
Tell them to scour the market.

519
01:04:28.708 --> 01:04:29.917
Yes. sir.

520
01:04:39.250 --> 01:04:41.292
- What is this?
- A gift.

521
01:04:42.000 --> 01:04:44.500
When you catch him.

522
01:04:44.583 --> 01:04:46.667
I want to be the one to pull the trigger.

523
01:04:47.333 --> 01:04:49.542
If you let me do that.

524
01:04:50.125 --> 01:04:52.667
I'll give you the other finger!

525
01:05:08.750 --> 01:05:09.958
He made me feel like a fool.

526
01:05:11.500 --> 01:05:12.708
Of course he did.

527
01:05:16.125 --> 01:05:18.458
You're only a kid. Hmm?

528
01:05:37.208 --> 01:05:41.333
Here's some advice. a gift.

529
01:05:43.333 --> 01:05:46.583
Keep your other finger.

530
01:05:47.250 --> 01:05:51.125
Because no matter how badass
you think you are...

531
01:05:51.750 --> 01:05:55.458
there's always a badass
who's bigger than you.

532
01:06:19.125 --> 01:06:20.125
Tyler.

533
01:06:22.375 --> 01:06:23.375
Yeah?

534
01:06:24.917 --> 01:06:28.792
If you had been killed today.
it would have been my fault.

535
01:06:32.000 --> 01:06:34.750
No. mate. But it would've been my fault.

536
01:06:36.667 --> 01:06:38.208
You don't look like a Tyler.

537
01:06:41.042 --> 01:06:42.208
No?

538
01:06:42.292 --> 01:06:43.333
What do I look like?

539
01:06:46.417 --> 01:06:47.417
A Brad.

540
01:06:51.875 --> 01:06:52.875
Yeah.

541
01:06:56.500 --> 01:06:58.000
Can I ask you something?

542
01:06:59.500 --> 01:07:00.500
It's Rake.

543
01:07:01.250 --> 01:07:03.208
- What's Rake?
- My last name.

544
01:07:04.208 --> 01:07:05.917
That's not what I was going to ask.

545
01:07:07.125 --> 01:07:08.875
That's a strange last name. though.

546
01:07:10.208 --> 01:07:12.125
Isn't that like a gardening tool?

547
01:07:16.292 --> 01:07:17.500
What were you gonna ask me?

548
01:07:19.667 --> 01:07:25.667
If you were always this way.
You know... brave.

549
01:07:26.292 --> 01:07:27.667
I'm not brave. mate.

550
01:07:29.500 --> 01:07:33.292
Of course you are. You rescue people.

551
01:07:34.667 --> 01:07:38.667
Yeah. sometimes.
Sometimes I do other things.

552
01:07:41.625 --> 01:07:42.875
Like killing people?

553
01:07:45.792 --> 01:07:46.792
Yeah.

554
01:07:48.333 --> 01:07:51.167
My father. he kills people. too.

555
01:07:53.000 --> 01:07:58.792
Sometimes. I would sit with him at dinner.
look at him and think.

556
01:08:00.417 --> 01:08:02.750
he just killed somebody else's father
that day.

557
01:08:04.542 --> 01:08:05.792
And I'd feel sick.

558
01:08:25.042 --> 01:08:26.458
You have a family?

559
01:08:29.083 --> 01:08:31.250
I did have me a wife.

560
01:08:32.167 --> 01:08:33.208
Where is she?

561
01:08:34.208 --> 01:08:37.792
I don't know.
I haven't seen her in a long time.

562
01:08:39.833 --> 01:08:41.083
Children?

563
01:08:43.417 --> 01:08:44.625
Yeah. a son.

564
01:08:46.125 --> 01:08:47.208
Where is he?

565
01:08:53.375 --> 01:08:55.208
He died a few years ago.

566
01:08:58.500 --> 01:08:59.625
How did he die?

567
01:09:02.042 --> 01:09:03.042
Lymphoma.

568
01:09:12.042 --> 01:09:13.042
How old was he?

569
01:09:16.625 --> 01:09:17.625
Six.

570
01:09:26.917 --> 01:09:30.875
I wasn't even there... when he died.

571
01:09:33.333 --> 01:09:34.750
Where were you?

572
01:09:37.000 --> 01:09:40.125
Kandahar. Afghanistan.
It was my third tour.

573
01:09:42.208 --> 01:09:43.375
You were called away?

574
01:09:52.208 --> 01:09:53.208
No.

575
01:09:57.875 --> 01:09:59.000
I left.

576
01:10:01.833 --> 01:10:02.958
Voluntary.

577
01:10:07.875 --> 01:10:09.250
Because you couldn't watch?

578
01:10:15.125 --> 01:10:16.125
Yep.

579
01:10:23.250 --> 01:10:25.625
I told you. mate. I'm not brave.
I'm just...

580
01:10:27.500 --> 01:10:28.917
I'm just the opposite.

581
01:10:32.375 --> 01:10:33.375
You know...

582
01:10:36.875 --> 01:10:41.333
"You drown not by falling into the river.

583
01:10:43.042 --> 01:10:44.875
but by staying submerged in it."

584
01:10:49.542 --> 01:10:50.917
Who told you that?

585
01:10:52.083 --> 01:10:53.750
I read it in a book in school.

586
01:11:31.792 --> 01:11:35.875
<i>Estancia Los Chanares.</i>

587
01:11:35.958 --> 01:11:38.208
- Yes. Yes!
- I don't know...

588
01:11:38.292 --> 01:11:39.917
It's the best dove hunting in Argentina.

589
01:11:40.583 --> 01:11:44.208
Just lie in this pool...
You lie in a pool and they fly around!

590
01:11:45.833 --> 01:11:48.458
And you shoot them.

591
01:11:48.542 --> 01:11:50.167
And you sip a Cuba Libre.

592
01:11:51.208 --> 01:11:55.458
I shot my first dove when I was
ten years old. Have I told you this?

593
01:11:55.542 --> 01:11:57.417
- I haven't. Listen.
- I think you have.

594
01:11:57.500 --> 01:12:02.083
No. It was when I was ten years old.
my dad... My dad... The gun backfired.

595
01:12:02.167 --> 01:12:05.000
gave me a black eye.
and my dad laughs at me.

596
01:12:05.083 --> 01:12:09.083
I used to move so quick.
kill those little shits.

597
01:12:10.375 --> 01:12:11.375
Not anymore. though.

598
01:12:12.500 --> 01:12:14.917
It sucks getting old. man. Sucks!

599
01:12:15.000 --> 01:12:16.833
- Getting old sucks.
- Shh.

600
01:12:16.917 --> 01:12:18.208
Sucks!

601
01:12:20.000 --> 01:12:21.250
I think he's asleep.

602
01:12:25.500 --> 01:12:27.542
What a goddamn tragedy. hmm?

603
01:12:31.417 --> 01:12:33.667
That kid is a walking corpse.

604
01:12:40.417 --> 01:12:42.083
Asif will never let him live.

605
01:12:44.042 --> 01:12:45.292
Think the disgrace.

606
01:12:46.375 --> 01:12:50.708
I mean. you get him home. And then. what?
His father's in prison.

607
01:12:52.042 --> 01:12:53.542
There's no way to protect him.

608
01:12:57.542 --> 01:12:59.182
You know what the best thing
you could do?

609
01:12:59.208 --> 01:13:02.125
The best thing you could do. honestly.
would be to go up there right now

610
01:13:02.917 --> 01:13:05.917
and just go put a bullet in his brain.
Make it painless.

611
01:13:08.000 --> 01:13:12.583
'Cause the animals out there.
they're not gonna be... as kind to him.

612
01:13:14.875 --> 01:13:16.542
They like to start with the ears.

613
01:13:17.875 --> 01:13:20.667
Then they cut off
each finger at the joint.

614
01:13:20.750 --> 01:13:21.833
Mate. you're drunk.

615
01:13:25.333 --> 01:13:27.417
I'm talking about mercy. Tyler.

616
01:13:36.250 --> 01:13:37.792
You know how much he's worth?

617
01:13:39.208 --> 01:13:40.568
We're talking about a kid. Gaspar.

618
01:13:40.625 --> 01:13:42.500
We're talking about a gangster's kid.

619
01:13:44.708 --> 01:13:46.542
With a price tag
of ten million on his head.

620
01:13:46.625 --> 01:13:48.167
You need to sober up. mate.

621
01:13:49.542 --> 01:13:53.875
You're a mercenary. right. Tyler?
Why don't you act the mercenary?

622
01:13:54.833 --> 01:13:57.458
Aren't you sick of this life?
'Cause I am and I...

623
01:13:58.833 --> 01:14:03.667
I do not wanna end it playing hero
on some goddamn suicide mission...

624
01:14:03.750 --> 01:14:05.542
What are you doing?
You said you'd help me.

625
01:14:05.625 --> 01:14:08.708
I am helping you. Ten million dollars.

626
01:14:10.375 --> 01:14:12.333
I'll get you to the border
in a couple hours.

627
01:14:12.417 --> 01:14:16.708
It's money in your pocket.
I take care of the body. Painless.

628
01:14:16.792 --> 01:14:18.583
And it's the best that
that kid can hope for.

629
01:14:21.000 --> 01:14:22.000
Did you call someone?

630
01:14:22.667 --> 01:14:23.917
Who'd you call?

631
01:14:24.000 --> 01:14:27.583
Why are you such a hypocrite? You've got
the blood of a hundred men on your hands...

632
01:14:27.667 --> 01:14:28.667
Answer me!

633
01:14:30.083 --> 01:14:32.375
Put your hands on me?

634
01:14:32.458 --> 01:14:33.458
What'd you do?

635
01:14:33.500 --> 01:14:37.000
Do you know what happens to me
if they find out that I'm helping you?

636
01:14:37.083 --> 01:14:39.083
You know what happens to my wife?

637
01:14:40.625 --> 01:14:41.625
Asif's a friend.

638
01:14:42.917 --> 01:14:45.292
I did some work for him.
We made a deal.

639
01:14:46.000 --> 01:14:49.958
He gets the kid. you get your freedom.
and we both get rich.

640
01:14:50.042 --> 01:14:52.500
What do you want from me?
Walk upstairs and shoot the kid

641
01:14:52.583 --> 01:14:53.625
in the fucking head?

642
01:14:53.708 --> 01:14:57.375
No. No. I'll do it.

643
01:15:03.417 --> 01:15:04.250
Don't do this.

644
01:15:04.333 --> 01:15:05.667
You saved my life once.

645
01:15:08.458 --> 01:15:09.667
Now I'm gonna save yours.

646
01:15:12.250 --> 01:15:13.375
Step aside.

647
01:15:38.875 --> 01:15:40.500
Come on. Tyler. Stop!

648
01:16:00.333 --> 01:16:02.333
What are we doing. man? Huh?

649
01:16:04.167 --> 01:16:05.500
Come on. stay down.

650
01:16:06.000 --> 01:16:07.000
Stay down.

651
01:16:26.208 --> 01:16:27.208
Hey. kid.

652
01:16:39.042 --> 01:16:41.875
I know it looks bad. I know it looks bad.

653
01:18:06.750 --> 01:18:08.417
I want to go home.

654
01:18:19.750 --> 01:18:20.958
I'll get you home. mate.

655
01:18:26.167 --> 01:18:27.250
I'll get you home.

656
01:18:48.250 --> 01:18:51.458
<i>I've got the boy.
I need your help.</i>

657
01:19:21.958 --> 01:19:22.958
Stay here.

658
01:19:57.625 --> 01:19:58.625
Just like that?

659
01:19:59.250 --> 01:20:00.708
Yeah. just like that.

660
01:20:01.250 --> 01:20:03.708
I want the boy out of here.
That's all I care about.

661
01:20:05.208 --> 01:20:06.208
Why?

662
01:20:07.292 --> 01:20:08.292
'Cause I do.

663
01:20:13.042 --> 01:20:15.875
He was gonna kill my family
if I didn't get his son back.

664
01:20:26.708 --> 01:20:28.518
My people are waiting for him
on the other side

665
01:20:28.542 --> 01:20:29.958
of the Sultana Kamal bridge.

666
01:20:30.667 --> 01:20:32.875
There's two blockades
between here and there.

667
01:20:32.958 --> 01:20:34.833
I'll do my best
to draw them away from both.

668
01:20:45.208 --> 01:20:46.750
You get him to the other side.

669
01:20:55.542 --> 01:20:56.542
Tyler.

670
01:21:00.375 --> 01:21:01.375
See you soon. mate.

671
01:21:07.417 --> 01:21:08.458
Let's go.

672
01:21:09.792 --> 01:21:10.792
Come on.

673
01:21:50.958 --> 01:21:51.958
Do you trust him?

674
01:21:53.625 --> 01:21:54.625
I do.

675
01:22:04.042 --> 01:22:05.083
Seat belt.

676
01:22:41.792 --> 01:22:43.292
Run fast!

677
01:22:46.375 --> 01:22:47.917
Go. go. go!

678
01:22:50.500 --> 01:22:51.958
Oh. sh...

679
01:23:16.333 --> 01:23:18.250
We'll have to go on foot.

680
01:23:45.083 --> 01:23:46.500
Any sign of the boy?

681
01:23:47.083 --> 01:23:48.208
Not yet.

682
01:23:48.833 --> 01:23:50.625
But we've seen our friend...

683
01:23:51.250 --> 01:23:52.583
the kid must be near.

684
01:24:08.125 --> 01:24:09.365
Grenade!

685
01:24:31.083 --> 01:24:33.542
We need to go to India.

686
01:24:34.250 --> 01:24:36.708
You can't go.
I'm telling you. you can't go.

687
01:24:46.375 --> 01:24:48.500
Hey! You there!

688
01:24:51.625 --> 01:24:56.292
Hey! Hey. stop!
Don't cross the bridge.

689
01:24:58.792 --> 01:25:00.917
Hey! I'm telling you to stop!

690
01:25:01.000 --> 01:25:02.625
Hey. stop!

691
01:25:06.583 --> 01:25:08.500
- Take his hat off. Let me see his face.
- Huh?

692
01:25:08.583 --> 01:25:09.458
I don't understand.

693
01:25:09.542 --> 01:25:11.583
His hat. Take it off.

694
01:25:17.375 --> 01:25:18.917
Do what he says.

695
01:25:19.000 --> 01:25:20.458
Take off your cap.

696
01:25:40.375 --> 01:25:42.101
- Move! Move!
- Go. go. go!

697
01:25:42.125 --> 01:25:43.125
Stay here.

698
01:26:26.750 --> 01:26:28.590
Take two more units
to the bridge.

699
01:26:30.333 --> 01:26:32.042
Two units to the bridge. Hurry!

700
01:26:33.458 --> 01:26:34.792
Bring me my rifle!

701
01:27:15.542 --> 01:27:19.833
Stay here. Stay down.
I'm gonna draw them away from you.

702
01:27:23.875 --> 01:27:24.875
Go.

703
01:28:35.958 --> 01:28:37.875
Rake. I need you on the bridge!

704
01:28:38.875 --> 01:28:39.958
Yeah. on my way.

705
01:28:41.958 --> 01:28:43.250
Oh. sh...

706
01:30:30.208 --> 01:30:31.083
Where's the kid?

707
01:30:31.167 --> 01:30:33.559
<i>In hiding.
About halfway across the bridge.</i>

708
01:30:33.583 --> 01:30:34.958
I'm trying to clear a path.

709
01:30:39.542 --> 01:30:41.375
Yaz. where are you?

710
01:30:42.083 --> 01:30:43.083
Two minutes out.

711
01:32:57.792 --> 01:33:02.042
Fuck! I'm taking fire.
I'm going... I'm going around.

712
01:36:06.583 --> 01:36:08.000
You see that helicopter?

713
01:36:12.083 --> 01:36:15.708
I need you to run
as fast as you can for it.

714
01:36:16.708 --> 01:36:19.542
No. Please. Please. get up.

715
01:36:31.417 --> 01:36:34.333
Bogeys are down.
LZ clear. Two-minute window.

716
01:36:35.833 --> 01:36:36.833
Go.

717
01:36:37.708 --> 01:36:40.292
- Please...
- Run.

718
01:36:42.375 --> 01:36:43.375
Run!

719
01:36:44.305 --> 01:37:44.322
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
